\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Create a vine surface, slowing down creatures, possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangling</a> them. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">Main Hand Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Make a melee attack with your equipped weapon. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Club\" title=\"Magic Club\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Club\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Magical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Magical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Club\" title=\"Magic Club\">Magic Club</a></span></dt><dd>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\">Wood Woad's</a> hand, a common <a href=\"/wiki/Club\" title=\"Club\">club</a> becomes magical and deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage extra.</dd></dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dryad\" title=\"Dryad\">Dryad</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The wood woad is directly controlled by the dryad's summoner.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034434\nCache expiry